it and they do it well.

00:57:32.244 --> 00:57:35.106
- It's also the fact that
sometimes there are just some,

00:57:35.106 --> 00:57:37.743
you know, phrases and like, you know,

00:57:37.743 --> 00:57:38.906
meanings that just don't translate at all.

00:57:38.906 --> 00:57:40.992
- Right, again, I mean
like one of the best dubs

00:57:40.992 --> 00:57:41.825
of all time "Baccano,"

00:57:41.825 --> 00:57:43.716
like there's a lot of sentences

00:57:43.716 --> 00:57:46.337
