remotely what the guy said,

00:57:49.507 --> 00:57:50.831
but it's the same-

00:57:50.831 --> 00:57:51.664
- It makes sense contextually.

00:57:51.664 --> 00:57:53.342
- It's the same kind of feeling,

00:57:53.342 --> 00:57:55.041
but they've instead of
